meta {
  name: Delete Trucks (Bulk)
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/trucks/list
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "truckIds": [7826,7825,7823]
  }
}

docs {
  Soft-deletes several trucks in one call (`TruckResource.deleteTruckList`,
  `common/controller/TruckResource.java:439`). Roles: VAHN_ADMIN, TORG_ADMIN.
  Fill the `truckIds` array in the body before running.
  
  Always 200; each id is processed independently and reported as
  `[{ "truckId", "success", "errorMessage" }]`. Check every entry: a VERIFIED truck, a missing
  id or another torg's truck comes back with `success: false` instead of failing the request.
}
